# Codeowners for the files that define or enforce the quality gates.
#
# These paths are the gates themselves: whoever can change them unreviewed can
# switch enforcement off. Owner review is the mitigation Rival's round-3
# blocker asks for — it only bites once branch protection has "Require review
# from Code Owners" enabled on `main` (see docs/plans/dev-557-static-design-check.md §8).
#
# Owner must be a team that actually exists, or GitHub silently treats the rule
# as unowned and never requests a review. `@show-karma/dev` is verified via
# `gh api orgs/show-karma/teams`; `@show-karma/engineering` (used here before)
# does not exist and its rules were inert.

# Quality-gate metrics and the committed baseline.
/quality-baseline.json                  @show-karma/dev
/quality-limits.json                    @show-karma/dev
/scripts/quality-gate.js                @show-karma/dev
/.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml     @show-karma/dev

# Design-system check (DEV-557): the checker, its rule configuration and the
# workflow that blocks on it.
/scripts/check-design-system.js         @show-karma/dev
/scripts/design-check.config.json       @show-karma/dev
/.github/workflows/pr-checklist.yml     @show-karma/dev

# Local enforcement entry point.
/.husky/pre-commit                      @show-karma/dev

# This file decides who reviews the above.
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @show-karma/dev
